<title>USA: Evergreen Media has Q4 shr profit of $0.02.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Media has Q4 shr profit of $0.02.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended	 Year-Ended</p>
<p>				 December 31,	   December 31,</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	 1996     1995</p>
<p> Net revenues	     $88,720   $47,754   $293,850 $162,931</p>
<p> Operating income	   9,770     4,433     17,960   13,777</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	  1,094   (1,037)   (16,194)  (5,850)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per</p>
<p> common share(a)	     0.02    (0.08)     (0.66)   (0.52)</p>
<p> Avg shrs (a)		36,654    28,043     30,207   20,721</p>
<p>(a) These figures give effect to the August 26, 1996 3-for-2 common stock split and the October 1996 issuance of 9,000,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
